==Overview==
A 4Koma and strategy app to enjoy "[[Nyanko Daisensou|The Great Cat War]]" to the fullest!

Gross-cute Cats and others rampage all over Japan. This is an app that allows you to enjoy such "The Great Cat War" even more. The Great Cat War 4Koma and Strategy App "Nyankoma"!

*This is the first time we've released a 4Koma manga for free.
*You can enjoy a wide variety of stories from seven different manga artists.
*It also includes a page introducing the Cats before and after their evolution, as well as the enemy characters.
*It also includes an article on the strategy of each stage of "The Great Cat War".
*We've also updated the page introducing Cat goods.

